Package: lasitan-cluster
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, systemd | systemd-sysv
Description: Lasitan-Cluster mesh (WireGuard over TCP + MC camouflage)
 Lasitan-Cluster control plane and agent binary. Transports WireGuard over
 length-prefixed TCP with optional Minecraft protocol camouflage. Not
 compatible with kernel WireGuard or stock UDP wireguard-go.
 .
 Installs the lasitan-cluster binary plus Master / Agent JSON examples under
 /etc/lasitan-cluster; everything else is managed from the Master web UI.
 On upgrade, running tunnels and the Master are restarted automatically.
